From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:44:03 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] hexagonrpcd: apps_std: fflush writes no output buffer

fflush has no output buffers, so clearing the first one read past the end of the output array on every call. It now only returns success.

Signed-off-by: seilent <github@seilent.net>
---
 hexagonrpcd/apps_std.c | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hexagonrpcd/apps_std.c b/hexagonrpcd/apps_std.c
index 7788df6..6e68134 100644
--- a/hexagonrpcd/apps_std.c
+++ b/hexagonrpcd/apps_std.c
@@ -69,8 +69,6 @@ static uint32_t apps_std_fflush(void *data,
 	printf("ignore fflush(%u)\n", *fd);
 #endif
 
-	memset(outbufs[0].p, 0, outbufs[0].s);
-
 	return 0;
 }
 
